MCSKIP MT,<>
MCINS %.
An invisible startline character can be inserted in front of every
line of input, so that a newline can be a macro name without the
first and last lines needing special treatment. Its keyword is SL.
MCSKIP SL WITH SPACE NL
MCDEF SL NL AS <%WA1.
>
MCSET S1=1
BEGIN   here is a labelled line
        this line is indented and goes away
LOOP    another labelled one
        and another indented one
END     the last labelled line
